# DPPO HalfCheetah reproduction

Status: smoke and seeds 0 and 1 completed; seed 2 running on its separate GPU.

## Question
Does the unmodified DPPO implementation and released HalfCheetah checkpoint reproduce the approximate Fig. 5 fine-tuning curve under the user's three-seed protocol?

## Answer so far
The smoke gate passed at 4,272.95. Seeds 0 and 1 each completed all 140 iterations and 10.08 million training steps, exited normally, and passed verification of five finite checkpoints. Their process wall times were 2h03m35s and 2h03m00s. Seed 0's last evaluation was 4,636.27 at 9.36 million steps; the three-seed assessment awaits seed 2 and the approved analysis. [Seed 0 record](runs/seed0_handoff/manifest.json), [seed 1 record](runs/seed1/manifest.json), [live seed 2 status](runs/seed2/monitor_status.md).

