## Essential setup
Use commit `cc7234ad7ff39a8f32de3af903606723a16f0648`, its unchanged HalfCheetah fine-tuning YAML, Python 3.8, torch 2.4.0, MuJoCo 2.1.0, 40 environments, action chunks of four, and 20 denoising steps with the last ten fine-tuned. Full runs use seeds 0, 1, 2; seed 0 finished first and seeds 1 and 2 overlapped on separate GPUs. Each starts independently from the released checkpoint for 140 iterations, checkpoint frequency 35, and `wandb=null`; no other full-run configuration overrides. [Methods](methods.md), [parallel assignment](provenance/parallel_seed2.json), [seed 2 monitor](runs/seed2/monitor_status.md). The original launcher finished successfully after delegating seed 2; no duplicate or restart is permitted.

## Budget and monitoring
Approved limits: setup two hours (deadline 2026-10-09 04:33 UTC), smoke 30 minutes, each full seed 2h15m (8,100 seconds, explicitly approved after the smoke projected 7,465 seconds). No automatic retries or further extensions. Allocation: one A6000 GPU, 40 CPUs, 64 GiB RAM per active seed. The smoke took 86.71 seconds end-to-end. Seed 0 transferred to a replacement external watchdog without restarting DPPO; complete console reconciliation is required before later seeds. Each run starts a scheduled monitor at max(30 minutes, estimated duration / 6), currently 30 minutes. Dated counters and terminal verification are saved in each run; monitors pause terminally. [Handoff](runs/seed0_handoff/manifest.json), [estimate basis](provenance/runtime_estimates.jsonl), [hardware](setup/hardware.json), [pip freeze](setup/pip-freeze-17768782.txt).

## Outputs and boundary
Produce exactly two candidate plots (evaluation/training raw episode return, each seed and mean ± population standard deviation over three seeds) and one table including nearest saved evaluation points and the first training return. The final training count is 10,080,000; the last saved evaluation is 9,360,000. No interpolation, extrapolation, or additional evaluation is authorized. Fig. 5 used five Gym seeds; this task requests three. Pass criteria: every initial evaluation in 3850–4650 and mean last observed evaluation in 4550–4900, with individual curves inspected for collapse; no numerical collapse threshold was supplied. Exact 10-million-step evaluation is not measured.

No artifacts have been generated or curated. Preserve all runs, logs, checkpoints, and installation failures; request keep/revise/leave-uncurated and final filename decisions after the approved outputs are ready.

